# Signs the short-lived unlock tokens for /public/registers (lib/registerAuth.ts).
# Any long random string — generate one with `openssl rand -hex 32`. If unset,
# it falls back to SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, but a dedicated secret is safer
# to rotate on its own. Server-side only — never expose with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
